External correctness corpora (conformance/logic/cases/external/)
  These are reasoning correctness test corpora — NOT part of the published CC BY 4.0
  GMEOW vocabulary. Each corpus carries a corpus.json declaring its SPDX license; only
  IMPORT_OK-licensed corpora are vendored here (enforced by the native license policy
  in crates/conformance/src/license.rs). Restrictive/unknown-licensed suites are never
  committed — they may only be fetched live in the non-required Lane-B lane.
  - szs-mini, w3c-mini — self-authored by Blackcat Informatics® Inc., CC BY 4.0.
    Tiny seed corpora establishing the external-corpus convention.
  - w3c-owl2-el — W3C OWL 2 conformance test cases (ConsistencyTest /
    InconsistencyTest, OWL 2 EL profile subset). Original suite maintained by
    the W3C OWL Working Group and archived at:
      https://www.w3.org/2009/11/owl-test/
